WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Earthquakes strike every day,

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
but current detection systems

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.000
are expensive and not ubiquitous.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Imagine if washing machines or smart TVs

5
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.500
had a tiny built-in sensor

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.500
at no extra cost to you:

7
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.000
together they could form

8
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
a global network serving science!

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
This is QuakeGuard:

10
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
ultra-small sensors

11
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
embedded inside household appliances

12
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
to detect earthquakes

13
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
and alert us on our phones in real-time.

14
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
All of this is Open Source on GitHub.

15
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
QuakeGuard:

16
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
safety starts with everyday objects.